  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The root cause for the automatic reactor trip was licensed operations personnel failing to properly utilize human performance tools and procedures. The procedure step to verify/open the steam generator low flow feedwater upstream isolation valves was not completed prior to raising reactor power per the startup procedure based on the incorrect assumption the isolation valves had been opened several shifts prior as a part of another procedure.",
